	<div id="dnn_ctr9628_HtmlModule_lblContent"><h1>Manual Letters (Revisions to Manual)</h1>

<p>The following are links to CDSS Manual Letters on-line in Portable Document Format (pdf). Manual Letters provide regulation manual holders with copies of updated manual pages. The Electronic Manuals on this site contain the updated manual pages.</p>

<p><strong>PLEASE NOTE: All Manual Letters and Regulations published by CDSS are available on this website for public use. </strong></p>

<p></p>

